flowchart TB
accTitle: Visibility time and receive budget solve different problems
accDescr: A receive makes a message temporarily invisible. Success leads to deletion. An uncompleted attempt may become eligible again, but the redrive receive budget limits retries before dead-letter handling.
Q["Available SQS job"]:::inputData --> R["Receive attempt<br/>Visibility window begins"]:::process
R --> S{"Work completes<br/>and message deleted?"}:::decision
S -->|Yes| D["Completed job"]:::output
S -->|No| V["Visibility expires<br/>Job eligible again"]:::process
V --> B{"Receive budget<br/>permits retry?"}:::decision
B -->|Yes| Q
B -->|No| L["Dead-letter queue<br/>Investigate and redrive"]:::warning
